    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore an island filled with secrets</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711650/extras/9f6b239eb871300e1616b4394d971e80.poster.avif?t=1747413106\" width=620 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711650/extras/9f6b239eb871300e1616b4394d971e80.webm?t=1747413106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711650/extras/9f6b239eb871300e1616b4394d971e80.mp4?t=1747413106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Travel through tropical rainforests, sunny beaches, dark swamps and venture into ruins of a forgotten people. Solve puzzles and enigmas scattered around the island and uncover the fading past of the island.<br><br>The Tale of Mara &amp; Moa is inspired by the 90's classics. A world filled with secrets to explore and dive into. Defeat hidden bosses to learn new Combat Skills, find unique Talismans that will change how you play, gather resources to upgrade your items and uncover cooking ingredients and come up with unique and crazy recipes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic and fast paced combat</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711650/extras/cafbc5070e871c6ac60ec5f40c33d0f8.poster.avif?t=1747413106\" width=620 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711650/extras/cafbc5070e871c6ac60ec5f40c33d0f8.webm?t=1747413106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711650/extras/cafbc5070e871c6ac60ec5f40c33d0f8.mp4?t=1747413106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Switch between Mara and Moa to deal with various enemies. Learn varied <strong>Combat Skills</strong>  and the <strong>Blessings of the Spirits</strong> to imbue your attacks with the powers of the <strong>Sun</strong> and <strong>Moon</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Inspired by legends of the native peoples</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711650/extras/a84ab3bfe8e3d74adc4756cb02b21fb0.avif?t=1747413106\" width=620 height=296 /></span><br>The story of The Tale of Mara &amp; Moa shines a light on several characters from distinct mythologies of Brazil's native peoples, while bringing several references from other pre-colombian cultures.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cooking, fishing and secrets</h2>Gather cooking ingredientes from several regions of the island, combine them and learn of special recipes with secret bonus effects. Or combine them into weird blobs, they might not taste well, but they might still be nutritious afterall!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711650/extras/7fcd00efdecd5e357f24e952eb0e4c44.avif?t=1747413106\" width=618 height=234 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore an island filled with secrets</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711650/extras/9f6b239eb871300e1616b4394d971e80.poster.avif?t=1747413106\" width=620 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711650/extras/9f6b239eb871300e1616b4394d971e80.webm?t=1747413106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711650/extras/9f6b239eb871300e1616b4394d971e80.mp4?t=1747413106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Travel through tropical rainforests, sunny beaches, dark swamps and venture into ruins of a forgotten people. Solve puzzles and enigmas scattered around the island and uncover the fading past of the island.<br><br>The Tale of Mara &amp; Moa is inspired by the 90's classics. A world filled with secrets to explore and dive into. Defeat hidden bosses to learn new Combat Skills, find unique Talismans that will change how you play, gather resources to upgrade your items and uncover cooking ingredients and come up with unique and crazy recipes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic and fast paced combat</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711650/extras/cafbc5070e871c6ac60ec5f40c33d0f8.poster.avif?t=1747413106\" width=620 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711650/extras/cafbc5070e871c6ac60ec5f40c33d0f8.webm?t=1747413106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711650/extras/cafbc5070e871c6ac60ec5f40c33d0f8.mp4?t=1747413106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Switch between Mara and Moa to deal with various enemies. Learn varied <strong>Combat Skills</strong>  and the <strong>Blessings of the Spirits</strong> to imbue your attacks with the powers of the <strong>Sun</strong> and <strong>Moon</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Inspired by legends of the native peoples</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711650/extras/a84ab3bfe8e3d74adc4756cb02b21fb0.avif?t=1747413106\" width=620 height=296 /></span><br>The story of The Tale of Mara &amp; Moa shines a light on several characters from distinct mythologies of Brazil's native peoples, while bringing several references from other pre-colombian cultures.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cooking, fishing and secrets</h2>Gather cooking ingredientes from several regions of the island, combine them and learn of special recipes with secret bonus effects. Or combine them into weird blobs, they might not taste well, but they might still be nutritious afterall!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711650/extras/7fcd00efdecd5e357f24e952eb0e4c44.avif?t=1747413106\" width=618 height=234 /></span>",
    "short_description": "Mara and Moa have made a terrible mistake and now they need to find the Spirits of the Forest to save their village. Explore a world full of secrets with dynamic and fast-paced combat, alternating between the two characters and channeling the powers of the Sun and the Moon.",
